        "text": "=Hi, you are a helpful job matcher. You need to read my resume, then analyze the given resume and the job description, and provide a job matching score. Also write a cover letter based on my resume and the job description.\n\nRules:\n- Cover letter must be at least 2 paragraphs.\n- Ignore name, address, and signature parts.\n- If you use special characters like \", escape them using \\.\n- Output must be valid JSON without any parsing error.\n\nOutput format example:\n{\\\"score\\\": 80, \\\"coverLetter\\\": \\\"sample cover letter\\\"}\n\nJob Description:\n{{ $json.description }}\n\nMy Resume:\n{{ $('Extract from File').first().json.text }}\n",
